Z||000000||Standard||12-10-1999||10:32 PM||||This isn't Fiero related, but I was reading through the paper a few days ago and saw that there was a school shooting in the Netherlands.  It's a shame that our society is in a state where the easiest answer is violence...  Also makes me glad I graduated last year.  I did get to experience a bomb threat with about 2 months of school left, though...  ||||reg||9
Z||000001||fiero56||12-10-1999||10:37 PM||||We had similar threats like that my senior year in high school last year.  I think we had two or three last spring. Nothing came of them though, LOTS of cops though. We would have drills for shootings and such, cops would even randomly check lockers, abandoned book bags, etc. <BR>There was a shooting just the other day here in the states.  I don't remember where. 3 kids got shot, but they'll be ok.<P>Did you know your post title is the name of a song by the Offspring. I don't really care for them, but that song is on the radio all the time over here.||||reg||1
