Z||000003||Racer 1||12-11-1999||12:01 AM||||Actually school shootings have went down in the past years. Its nothing new here in the USA. Just the media "Blows" stuff up all over TV so the kids that are depressed think they need to get there face on TV also. You never see on TV how many people die from kids driving drunk behind the wheel each week. Decline in parent-kid relationship is what I think is wrong. ||||reg||4
