Z||000005||dogtired||12-11-1999||01:23 AM||||It has been 30 years plus since I was in High School. Even then we had bomb threats, It seemed fun at the time cause they never found anything and we were all outside watching the cops.<BR>It is too bad WE have created this environment, seems we have become gun happy, but think back 100 years and everyone carried side arms? <BR>There never really was "the good old days" but we would be better off to adopt some of those lost family values. <BR>So do your part. grab one of your kids and go out and work on the FIERO. Perhaps maybe you will even have a converrsation with them?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||9
