Z||000011||ChadMan||12-15-1999||09:02 AM||||Two of my most cherished freedoms as an American are the right to own firearms and the ability to travel anywhere in the country in my own personal automobile.<P>Ever notice how the same folks who'd like to force you out of your Fiero and onto stinking, overcrowded public transportation are usually the same folks who'd like to take your guns?<P>OK.  I'll climb down from my soapbox now.  Remember, vote Ogre/ChadMan in 2000.||||reg||1
