Z||000016||dogtired||12-15-1999||05:07 PM||||I remember seeing a flim, 1963, yah I am old. IT was about a trick shooter, targets, clay pegons and hunting. Anyway the point of this it at the end of the film he says:<BR>"Take your kids hunting today then you will not have to go hunting for for your kids later".<BR>Thats why I said in my first response, grab your kid and go work on the car. Just get involved in their life!<P>I think I tore the seat out of my Flame suit?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">||||reg||1
