Z||000018||87GTBro||12-15-1999||11:50 PM||||I also think the biggest cause of this outrageous behavior in youth today is the lack of good relationship within the family.  Also parents just "DONT CARE" anymore.  Another cause is the lack of proper punishment.  <BR>I went to private school in elementary and you wouldn't dare do anything wrong or disrespect the teachers or else your butt was taken downstairs to the principal's office and you were given a good old fashion whoopin'.<BR>Today, public schools can get sued for such punishment.  Now, proper punishment is putting the kid in a room with all the other trouble makers, give him/her all the work they are to do that day and somehow that is supposed to teach the kid not to do what they did to get in trouble.<BR>Parents are even afraid to punish their own kids with a paddle on their behind.  We have tied our own hands behind our backs.||||reg||1
